<head>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-EVSTQN3/azprG1Anm3QDgpJLIm9Nao0Yz1ztcQTwFspd3yD65VohhpuuCOmLASjC" crossorigin="anonymous">
</head>

<body>
    <div class="text-center my-3 mx-2">
        <h5 class="my-3">
            Perfavore, descrivi la tua proposta, puoi anche aggiungere un URL per fornire ulteriori dettagli.
        </h5>

        <br>
        
        <form class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 mx-auto" method="post">
            <textarea class="form-control my-2" name="text" placeholder="Descrivi qui la challenge.."></textarea>
            <input class="form-control my-2" name="url" type="url" placeholder="https://example.com"></input>
            <button class="btn btn-primary my-2" type=submit>Invia proposta</button>
        </form>
    </div>

</body>

